  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased voter understanding of voting system, principles of representative government, role of elections in democracy</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative aims to enhance voter awareness and comprehension of the electoral process, emphasizing three key components: understanding the voting system, principles of representative government, and the pivotal role of elections in a democratic society. The program will employ a multifaceted approach, incorporating targeted educational campaigns, engaging materials, and community outreach efforts to ensure a comprehensive understanding among the electorate. By focusing on these fundamental aspects, the initiative aspires to empower voters with the knowledge needed to make informed choices, fostering a more participatory and informed citizenry within the democratic framework. Through strategic communication and educational activities, the project seeks to strengthen the foundation of democratic values and practices among the voting population.
Indicators:
- Increased voter understanding of voting system, principles of representative government, role of elections in democracy
- Accurate media reporting on voting process and outcomes
- At least 5 CSOs engaged in civic ed by FEO reaching at least 100 communities across the country
- At least 10 journalists trained &amp; reporting more actively and accurately on election issues</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="0" year="2022"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="15"></target>
     <actual value="208"></actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
